Description: Universal QML plugin for SDDM greeter themes
 SddmSystemInfo is a Qt6/QML extension plugin for SDDM greeter themes.
 It provides a JsonStatusReader type that watches local JSON files
 and exposes their contents as QML properties, eliminating the need
 for XMLHttpRequest in the restricted SDDM greeter environment.
